cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If Cove helps your research, teaching, or product, please cite the project using this metadata."
title: "Cove: a calm, local-first Manifest V3 new tab workspace"
abstract: >-
  Cove is an open-source Apache-2.0 browser new tab extension for Chrome, Brave,
  Arc, Edge, Firefox, and Zen Browser. It combines a Midnight Cobalt spatial
  workspace, a clean RSS newsroom and offline reader with an IndexedDB cache,
  procedural Web Audio focus soundscapes, and an on-device Markov workflow engine
  without cloud telemetry.
